+L.push("\n### Base rates (mean predicted vs observed; bias CI; on-off |bias| CI)\n", "| rate | obs | off pred | off bias [CI] | on pred | on bias [CI] | |on|-|off| [CI] | anchored pred |", "|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|");
